# Base URL of beyzacevrim-api (no trailing slash).
# - in development leave it empty; the client uses http://localhost:5050 automatically;
# - on Vercel set it to the API project's address, e.g. https://beyzacevrim-api.vercel.app;
# - leave it empty if the API is served from the same domain under /api.
VITE_API_URL=
